OL,3,GNEWSAHarris genealogy centre's upgrade
OL,4,Asecures major funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA genealogy resource centre in the
OL,7,FWestern Isles has secured more than #8m
OL,8,Ftowards upgrading its facilities.
OL,10,FFollowing years of planning and
OL,11,Ffundraising, the investment will see
OL,12,Fthe Hebrides People Visitor Centre in
OL,13,FHarris transformed into a "modern,
OL,14,Faccessible heritage destination".
OL,16,FIts bosses said the upgrade would
OL,17,Fsafeguard the site's archive, which is
OL,18,Fbased on more than 60 years of research
OL,19,Fby Bill Lawson, a leading authority on
OL,20,FWestern Isles genealogy.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
